BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Canvass with us in Indiana Congressional District 5!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T130000
UID:8f2aed9dff7dfd906ec891985ee61204@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize%20Canvassing%20graphic%20CD5%20with%20Indiana%20map_
 20261005153141061812.png
DESCRIPTION:CD-5 is the most flippable red seat in Congress in Indiana - b
 ut we need YOUR help talking to voters to make that happen. In 2022\, Indi
 ana had the LOWEST midterm voter turnout in the country at 40%. There is a
  pervasive sense of "Indiana is red and always will be." But in truth: **I
 ndiana is a purple state that DOESN'T VOTE.** We have the chance this mont
 h to use our votes to end the corruption. End the violence. End the lies. 
 A House majority would give Democrats the ability to rein in Donald T
LOCATION:Fishers\, IN
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblecentralindiana/event/1054882/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana
END:VEVENT
