BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rush Hour Blast 4
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T150000
UID:ebe6adeb3cba040df90d7819a61a5037@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Kelly%20Thompson%20for%20Congress_20260922171458060875.png
DESCRIPTION:**Join us for our multi-event series called Rush Hour Blast** 
 Every Monday in October we'll be hitting the streets in Allen County durin
 g rush hour. Each Monday we'll be at a different location. On October 26 w
 e'll be assembling Coliseum Blvd in the grassy area between Parnell Ave an
 d the building entrance. During the event\, participants will be waving **
 Kelly Thompson for Congress** signs at passing automobiles. Also\, we will
  be collecting donations for **Center for Nonviolence.** This worthy o
LOCATION:Allen County War Memorial Coliseum\, 4000 Parnell Ave\, Fort Wayn
 e\, IN\, 46805
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblenortheastindiana/event/1042344/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Text Bank with the ACLU of Indiana
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T153000
UID:6a2f4cdbdf94157464c8e719f0a3261d@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize%20ACLU%20Text%20Banking_20261002152044323392.png
DESCRIPTION:Phone banking and text banking with the ACLU empowers voluntee
 rs to contact voters to mobilize support for key civil rights and educate 
 citizens about their voting rights. While virtual text banking is live\, t
 he advocacy team of ACLU of Indiana will host 30-minute Zoom orientations 
 most Tuesdays and Thursdays. These training and helpline sessions will ori
 ent new volunteers and address any questions that arise for volunteers alr
 eady trained and engaged in phone banking. ACLU of Indiana text banks
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/acluin/event/981206/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Central Indiana
END:VEVENT
